        }
   }
}
​

And now I am using Pex API to generate tests. But it is not working as expected. After running it, the output is "1 Test(s) Failed" and it does not show the input data.
Here is the code for the ArrayListAPI in which the contract testing is being done:
namespace PexAPIWrapper
{
    using System;
    using System.Collections;  

